% 0 1 0 1e86a0cbb7810f451936412b71c42a9d

% 1 1 0 06854df816d6d85f154b59a7b04bb607

% 2 1 0 0fb76dfacf2997e109a1f4a64b26583b

@ 0 1 0 1ca19c0d353f230a00bfd5816738cfee
+ Assim, cada transporte é escolhido pelo valor de socket:

% 2 1 0 0ca9ec1bbfc9989618ec47c9dfbf17a9

